      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        Self-hosted WireGuard
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-400 to-blue-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          VPN management
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">
        A clean web interface for managing WireGuard peers, firewall rules, and user authentication &mdash; without depending on any third-party cloud service. Fully transparent, fully yours.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
        <a
